{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54845","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛇赤（辛本、川本、京本作「诸」）色，大小外边来。\n来入我军兵欲敌（京本作「散」），更防引得外奸乖，德向（京本作「得上」）好通开（首本作「关」，兹从辛本、川本、京本）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}